    <string name="adventure_about">Colossal Cave Adventure version 2.50\nDon Wood&#x27;s Adventure 2.5: (c) Copyright 1995 by Donald R. Woods.\nThis program was originally developed by Willie Crowther. Most of the features of the current program were added by Don Woods. Contact Don if you have any questions, comments, etc.\nDrawings by Ralph Witt and David Platt, architects of the 1979 version of the game.\nKotlin conversion by Valdetaro Consulting, LLC, 2026.\n\nThis game is in the public domain.</string>
