    <string name="main_banner_content">Gepetto loves games. In this modern age, he likes computer games too! Since he is a bit old, he prefers classic games and games that require thinking.\n\nHe selected a bunch of classic games, plus some newer ones. There&#x27;s a few categories: Chatbots, Skill games, Luck games, Arcade game, Adventure games, plus multi-player games that can be played over wifi with others. You can pick the category bellow.\n\nThe icons bellow select the game categories. Enjoy!</string>
